# How to Run the Project

## Step 1
Install Python.

## Step 2
Install required libraries:

pip install pandas numpy matplotlib seaborn notebook

## Step 3
Open Jupyter Notebook:

jupyter notebook

## Step 4
Run:

Netflix_Data_Analysis.ipynb

